{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103231919256-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103232531\"/><p>垃圾站被烈火吞噬。</p><p>今晚(3日)10時49分，元朗八鄉錦上路近清潭路垃圾站起火，一時火光熊熊，火勢非常猛烈，途人市民見狀報案。消防接報趕至，立刻開喉射水灌救。受事件影響，現場道路需要封閉。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:01:24.648893+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:19:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T15:58:28.393645+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:58:28.393645+00:00","content_hash":"4e0934229bf46172bb818850d7fc0d2f75539180c4b7ed1f3cf7c140673f6aa0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}